---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import ConvertFormat from '../../components/tools/ConvertFormat';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="Convert WebP to PNG Free Online | Filekrush"
  description="Convert WebP images to PNG with lossless quality. No upload, runs in your browser."
  canonical="/convert/webp-to-png"
  heading="Convert WebP to PNG"
  subheading="Convert your WebP to PNG format — free, private, instant."
>
  <ConvertFormat client:only="react" fromFormat="image/webp" toFormat="image/png" />

  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Why convert WebP to PNG?</h2>
      <p>PNG preserves transparency and uses lossless compression. If you downloaded a WebP image and need to edit it, use it as a logo overlay, or upload it to a platform that doesn't accept WebP, converting to PNG is the way to go.</p>

      <h2>Will the file get larger?</h2>
      <p>Yes. PNG files are typically larger than WebP because PNG uses lossless compression. For a photo, expect a 2-4x size increase.</p>
    </section>
  </Fragment>
</ToolLayout>
